<title>USA: Raytheon group to build India power plant.</title>
<headline>Raytheon group to build India power plant.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raytheon Co on Wednesday said that it was part of a group that signed a letter of intent to build a $480 million power plant in India.</p>
<p>The award is for a 525-megawatt coal-fired power plant in Tuticorin in the state of Tamil Nadu, Raytheon said. The plant will be built for Southern Petrochemicals Industries Corp's electric power unit.</p>
</text>
